# Facts about Tamsin Reed (playtest 2, X9).

@fact tamsin.thornwick
tier: surface
text: An illusion student at Thornwick, in your year, who writes to you.

@fact tamsin.theatre
tier: personal
hint: Keep writing back.
unlock: rel(tamsin) >= 8
text: Their grandmother runs a travelling theatre; they learned illusion painting her backdrops.

@fact tamsin.assigned
tier: secret
hint: Ask why they wrote to you in the first place.
unlock: seen(tamsin_confession) > 0
text: Thornwick told them to write to a Lumenhold student and report back. They stopped reporting by the third letter.

@fact tamsin.pie
tier: personal
hint: Answer their second letter.
unlock: seen(tamsin_second_letter) > 0
text: Their roommate bet them a pie that you'd never write back. They won the pie.

@fact tamsin.sketches
tier: personal
hint: Let them tell you the Thornwick gossip.
unlock: seen(tamsin_letter_gossip) > 0
text: They fill their letters with sketches of Thornwick's professors in the margins. Their illusion professor is usually a goat.

@fact tamsin.failed
tier: personal
hint: Read the short letter.
unlock: seen(tamsin_letter_trouble) > 0
text: They once failed their illusion examination, the one thing they were good at, in the same term their grandmother's theatre was sold.
